  {
    "id": "it_net_xua2023playershandbookp8",
    "name": "Net",
    "source": "XUA2023PlayersHandbookP8",
    "page": 24,
    "type": "Adventuring Gear",
    "rawType": "G",
    "rarity": "none",
    "reqAttune": false,
    "weight": 3,
    "value": "1 gp",
    "ac": null,
    "bonusAc": null,
    "dmg1": null,
    "dmg2": null,
    "dmgType": null,
    "bonusWeapon": null,
    "properties": [],
    "isWeapon": false,
    "isArmor": false,
    "packContents": null,
    "attachedSpells": null,
    "macroTemplate": null,
    "descriptionMarkdown": "*Adventuring Gear*\n\n**Weight:** 3 lb | **Value:** 1 gp\n\n---\n\nWhen you take the Attack action on your turn, you can replace one of your attacks with a throw of the net at a creature within 15 feet of yourself. The target must make a Dexterity saving throw against a DC equal to 8 + your Proficiency Bonus + your Dexterity modifier. The target succeeds automatically if it's Huge or larger.\n\nOn a failed save, the target has the Restrained condition until it escapes the net. To escape, the target must use its action to make a 10 Strength (Athletics) check, escaping on a success. A creature within 5 feet of the target can use its action to attempt the same thing. Destroying the net (AC 10; 5 HP; immunity to Bludgeoning, Poison, and Psychic damage) also frees the target, ending the effect.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>When you take the Attack action on your turn, you can replace one of your attacks with a throw of the net at a creature within 15 feet of yourself. The target must make a Dexterity saving throw against a DC equal to 8 + your Proficiency Bonus + your Dexterity modifier. The target succeeds automatically if it's Huge or larger.</p>\n<p>On a failed save, the target has the Restrained condition until it escapes the net. To escape, the target must use its action to make a 10 Strength (Athletics) check, escaping on a success. A creature within 5 feet of the target can use its action to attempt the same thing. Destroying the net (AC 10; 5 HP; immunity to Bludgeoning, Poison, and Psychic damage) also frees the target, ending the effect.</p>"
  },
